TITLE
150 MeV proton pencil beam in water, field off
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO
BEAM          -0.150                                                  PROTON
BEAMPOS            0         0     0.001
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME
    0    0
RPP world -50 50 -50 50 -10 60
RPP tank -10 10 -5 5 0 30
END
OUTSIDE      5 -world
VACUUMR      5 +world -tank
PHANTOM      5 +tank
END
GEOEND
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   OUTSIDE
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   VACUUMR
ASSIGNMA       WATER   PHANTOM
USRBIN            10      DOSE       -21         5         2        20dose
USRBIN            -5        -2         0       100        40       200&
RANDOMIZ           1     12345
START          10000
STOP
